<!-- Fonts: self-hosted and declared inline, so first paint waits on no third-party
     stylesheet. Both text stacks lead with the system font, so on Apple devices these
     files never download; on Windows and Android only the ranges in use are fetched.
     Deliberately not preloaded: a preload would force the download for Apple users too.
     Inter and IBM Plex Sans are variable files; IBM Plex Mono 500 is omitted (never rendered). -->
